<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">imi wa nai no sa</font></b></font></font></font>

35
00:01:12,890 --> 00:01:13,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">there will be no meaning</font></b></font></font></font>

36
00:01:13,850 --> 00:01:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">dakara haruka kanata</font></b></font></font></font>

37
00:01:13,850 --> 00:01:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">and so we'll go far off into the distance</font></b></font></font></font>

38
00:01:30,900 --> 00:01:35,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, let the tenth round begin.</font>

39
00:01:35,820 --> 00:01:37,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do your best!</font>

40
00:01:37,490 --> 00:01:38,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fatso!</font>

41
00:01:40,870 --> 00:01:41,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

42
00:01:41,870 --> 00:01:43,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those two better watch out!</font>

43
00:01:43,580 --> 00:01:48,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll end this match quickly and
turn you into mincemeat!</font>

44
00:01:48,790 --> 00:01:50,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then let's not play around...</font>

45
00:01:50,630 --> 00:01:53,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll finish you off quickly, Mister Fatso.</font>

46
00:01:55,090 --> 00:01:58,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You bandaged cucumber roll!</font>

47
00:01:58,840 --> 00:02:03,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know his Achilles heel all too well
from my last battle with him.</font>

48
00:02:04,270 --> 00:02:08,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those holes in his arm emit
a pulsing sound, so...</font>

49
00:02:08,980 --> 00:02:10,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art!</font>

50
00:02:10,190 --> 00:02:11,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Expansion Jutsu!</font>

51
00:02:12,650 --> 00:02:14,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Followed by the
Hidden Leaf-style Taijutsu!</font>

52
00:02:18,820 --> 00:02:21,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All I have to do is to prevent him
from aiming at my ears!</font>

53
00:02:21,160 --> 00:02:23,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Human Boulder Jutsu!</font>

54
00:02:23,620 --> 00:02:26,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hooray for Big-Boned!</font>

55
00:02:27,460 --> 00:02:28,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good!</font>

56
00:02:28,460 --> 00:02:31,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Squash him, Choji!</font>

57
00:02:31,540 --> 00:02:36,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy can attack sonically without
even touching the opponent...</font>

58
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:40,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But that's only when ears are showing!</font>

59
00:02:40,930 --> 00:02:44,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With Choji's whole head buried,
it's like he's wearing ear plugs.</font>

60
00:02:44,100 --> 00:02:46,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">how does anyone make a sonic attack
on a meat ball,</font>

61
00:02:46,350 --> 00:02:48,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">let alone one that's rolling?</font>

62
00:02:53,270 --> 00:02:55,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The way you are...
you can barely move, can you?</font>

63
00:02:56,480 --> 00:02:57,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's where I attack!</font>

64
00:02:58,650 --> 00:03:00,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's no use, I'm wearing ear plugs.</font>

65
00:03:00,990 --> 00:03:03,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, this is the end!</font>

66
00:03:04,830 --> 00:03:05,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh?!</font>

67
00:03:13,790 --> 00:03:20,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The human body is made up of 70% water,
and water is able to transmit sound waves.</font>

68
00:03:21,130 --> 00:03:25,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words, your whole body is like
one big ear.</font>

69
00:03:28,930 --> 00:03:31,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And the winner is, Dosu Kinuta!</font>

70
00:03:34,020 --> 00:03:38,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru-sama... no, Orochimaru!</font>

71
00:03:39,030 --> 00:03:44,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll have you know that...
I'm more than a mere guinea pig.</font>

72
00:03:45,030 --> 00:03:46,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you all right?</font>

73
00:03:46,740 --> 00:03:48,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I want to eat meat...</font>

74
00:03:48,950 --> 00:03:51,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh man...
And the guy went easy on him, too.</font>

75
00:03:52,460 --> 00:03:56,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Although he lost, the least we can
do for him is take him for some BBQ beef.</font>

76
00:03:58,210 --> 00:04:00,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's finally over.</font>

77
00:04:01,340 --> 00:04:03,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At long last, the Final Round...</font>

78
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:09,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With this, the preliminaries for
the third exam is completed.</font>

79
00:04:10,220 --> 00:04:16,230
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Shadow that Stirs
in the Darkness</font>

80
00:04:11,930 --> 00:04:16,230
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Danger Approaches Sasuke!</font>

81
00:04:21,530 --> 00:04:24,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder what's happened to Naruto?</font>

82
00:04:25,530 --> 00:04:27,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go outside now.</font>

83
00:04:27,990 --> 00:04:31,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka-sensei hasn't been alert recently,
so now's our chance.</font>

84
00:04:31,500 --> 00:04:32,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

85
00:04:32,620 --> 00:04:33,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Konohamaru!</font>

86
00:04:34,210 --> 00:04:36,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You intend to sneak out again, do you?</font>

87
00:04:37,290 --> 00:04:38,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I need to go to the bathroom!</font>

88
00:04:38,590 --> 00:04:39,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Liar!</font>

89
00:04:41,090 --> 00:04:43,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To everyone who has advanced to
the Final Round</font>

90
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:45,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">of the third test of the Chunin Exams,</font>

91
00:04:46,550 --> 00:04:50,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's one person who's missing,
but, congratulations.</font>

92
00:04:52,100 --> 00:04:53,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Sensei...
— Hmm?</font>

93
00:04:54,770 --> 00:04:57,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have a question.</font>

94
00:04:58,820 --> 00:05:00,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">About Sasuke?</font>

95
00:05:01,320 --> 00:05:04,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I'm sorry, but I don't know much.</font>

96
00:05:05,200 --> 00:05:07,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But don't worry too much.</font>

97
00:05:08,490 --> 00:05:11,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From here on, it's up to Sasuke.</font>

98
00:05:14,540 --> 00:05:17,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura, I have to step out
for a moment.</font>

99
00:05:17,630 --> 00:05:19,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please inquire about the
details of the Final Round!</font>

100
00:05:21,130 --> 00:05:21,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure.</font>

101
00:05:25,680 --> 00:05:28,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here, in our house,
including Sasuke who's not here,</font>

102
00:05:29,510 --> 00:05:31,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we have five Leaf,</font>

103
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:34,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">three Sand,</font>

104
00:05:36,350 --> 00:05:38,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and one Sound.</font>

105
00:05:39,440 --> 00:05:42,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I will begin the explanation
of the Final Round.</font>

106
00:05:43,400 --> 00:05:45,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Finally!</font>

107
00:05:52,290 --> 00:05:54,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The preliminary battles have
ended without incident.</font>

108
00:05:54,370 --> 00:05:55,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems they're now entering
the Final Round.</font>

109
00:05:58,120 --> 00:06:00,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This land really has become
peaceful, hasn't it?</font>

110
00:06:00,330 --> 00:06:04,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This peaceful time has put
this country in slumber...</font>

111
00:06:05,840 --> 00:06:10,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">while all the other lands are busy racing
to expand their military.</font>

112
00:06:12,390 --> 00:06:14,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Would it be possible for us
to take it now?</font>

113
00:06:14,890 --> 00:06:17,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph, I suppose.</font>

114
00:06:17,890 --> 00:06:21,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Though, I don't know how much fun
it would be to take out that old man.</font>

115
00:06:22,770 --> 00:06:24,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that so?</font>

116
00:06:27,240 --> 00:06:31,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To me, it looks like you still have
hesitations about it.</font>

117
00:06:32,620 --> 00:06:34,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From now on, the power of
each Hidden Village will clash</font>

118
00:06:34,990 --> 00:06:36,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with one another in a long
and violent manner.</font>

119
00:06:37,460 --> 00:06:39,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Sound village is also one of them...</font>

120
00:06:40,420 --> 00:06:43,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You intend to be the trigger
for all of that...</font>

121
00:06:45,420 --> 00:06:49,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And use him for a bullet.</font>

122
00:06:49,550 --> 00:06:53,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Our Sasuke-kun... right?</font>

123
00:06:55,430 --> 00:06:57,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guess well.</font>

124
00:06:57,020 --> 00:06:58,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So well that it's a bit creepy.</font>

125
00:06:59,520 --> 00:07:01,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not in the slightest.</font>

126
00:07:01,730 --> 00:07:04,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I still had no idea about
Dosu, Zaku or Kin.</font>

127
00:07:06,110 --> 00:07:08,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In gathering information on Sasuke-kun,</font>

128
00:07:08,950 --> 00:07:10,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I desired to learn their skills</font>

129
00:07:10,990 --> 00:07:14,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and carried out tactless things like
deliberately subjecting myself to an attack.</font>

130
00:07:16,450 --> 00:07:18,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You overestimated me.</font>

131
00:07:19,960 --> 00:07:21,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems that you...</font>

132
00:07:21,460 --> 00:07:25,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you don't trust me completely... yet.</font>

133
00:07:27,090 --> 00:07:30,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Was it necessary to tell you,
my right-hand man,</font>

134
00:07:30,800 --> 00:07:33,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">about the likes of those three?</font>

135
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:36,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You see, therein lies
the very proof of my trust.</font>

136
00:07:41,190 --> 00:07:42,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And because I do...</font>

137
00:07:46,270 --> 00:07:49,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I would like to leave Sasuke-kun
in your hands.</font>

138
00:07:50,610 --> 00:07:52,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Curse Mark that was given to him...</font>

139
00:07:52,860 --> 00:07:55,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">appears to have been sealed by Kakashi.</font>

140
00:07:56,120 --> 00:07:59,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Though, that won't matter much.</font>

141
00:07:59,500 --> 00:08:02,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">While there is still some
darkness left in his heart...</font>

142
00:08:02,920 --> 00:08:05,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want you to abduct him.</font>

143
00:08:06,250 --> 00:08:09,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's an uncharacteristically
hasty request, is it not?</font>

144
00:08:10,550 --> 00:08:13,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's a little something troubling me...</font>

145
00:08:14,930 --> 00:08:16,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it Uzumaki Naruto?</font>

146
00:08:19,180 --> 00:08:22,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're quite a sharp one,
aren't you?</font>

147
00:08:23,350 --> 00:08:28,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun has lived for revenge
against his older brother Itachi,</font>

148
00:08:29,320 --> 00:08:32,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and will not rest until he
has achieved that aim.</font>

149
00:08:33,280 --> 00:08:35,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nevertheless, in battle with me,</font>

150
00:08:35,610 --> 00:08:38,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he was aware that there were things
beyond his power and</font>

151
00:08:38,280 --> 00:08:40,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">faced death without fear.</font>

152
00:08:40,660 --> 00:08:43,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't think he'd be the type of
person who would be in a hurry to die.</font>

153
00:08:44,710 --> 00:08:46,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">According to your information,</font>

154
00:08:46,460 --> 00:08:52,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">contact with that Nine-Tailed kid has
altered Sasuke-kun's heart and mind.</font>

155
00:08:53,630 --> 00:08:57,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So much so, that he possesses
some influence over Sasuke-kun.</font>

156
00:08:58,550 --> 00:09:01,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The best thing to do is to get Sasuke-kun
away from him immediately...</font>

157
00:09:02,770 --> 00:09:07,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And quickly turn him in my color.</font>

158
00:09:16,030 --> 00:09:17,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, then...</font>

159
00:09:17,070 --> 00:09:18,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kabuto...</font>

160
00:09:18,070 --> 00:09:19,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You...</font>

161
00:09:21,540 --> 00:09:23,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you wish to stop me...</font>

162
00:09:31,340 --> 00:09:35,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have no choice but
to kill young Sasuke-kun, now.</font>

163
00:09:36,880 --> 00:09:39,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't possibly kill me...</font>

164
00:09:39,930 --> 00:09:44,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Though you are strong, you're only
in the same league as Kakashi.</font>

165
00:09:55,490 --> 00:09:56,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just kidding...</font>

166
00:09:57,360 --> 00:09:58,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, run along.</font>

167
00:09:58,990 --> 00:10:01,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I trust you.</font>

168
00:10:08,420 --> 00:10:10,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That face...</font>

169
00:10:10,580 --> 00:10:12,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder what could possibly
be going on in his head?</font>

170
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:15,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Final Round is where
each one of you</font>

171
00:10:15,630 --> 00:10:18,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">will show off your battle skills
in front of everyone.</font>

172
00:10:18,430 --> 00:10:21,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want you to satisfactorily demonstrate
and show off your ability</font>

173
00:10:21,260 --> 00:10:24,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as representative battle forces
of your respective lands.</font>

174
00:10:25,350 --> 00:10:28,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Accordingly, the Final Round will
commence one month from now.</font>

175
00:10:29,560 --> 00:10:31,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-We're not going to
do it here, right now?</font>

176
00:10:32,360 --> 00:10:35,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is so that there's
a suitable period of preparation.</font>

177
00:10:36,150 --> 00:10:37,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean?</font>

178
00:10:38,070 --> 00:10:39,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is to say...</font>

179
00:10:39,450 --> 00:10:42,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Along with the announcement of
the conclusion</font>

180
00:10:42,070 --> 00:10:44,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">of the preliminary match to each
country's Feudal Lords and Shinobi leaders,</font>

181
00:10:44,870 --> 00:10:48,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">readying the summons for
Final Round requires preparation time—</font>

182
00:10:48,750 --> 00:10:54,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">not to mention the time it takes
for you examinees to prepare.</font>

183
00:10:54,380 --> 00:10:57,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This old man always has such
a roundabout way of saying things.</font>

184
00:10:57,840 --> 00:11:00,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't quite get what
you're trying to say.</font>

185
00:11:00,220 --> 00:11:01,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean?</font>

186
00:11:02,220 --> 00:11:04,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words,
in order to know your adversary,</font>

187
00:11:04,350 --> 00:11:06,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in order to prepare yourself,
time is necessary.</font>

188
00:11:06,640 --> 00:11:09,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Time to analyze what you learned about
the adversaries in the preliminaries...</font>

189
00:11:09,640 --> 00:11:12,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">time to take stock of your successes.</font>

190
00:11:12,350 --> 00:11:15,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The battles until now were
like actual battles-</font>

191
00:11:15,020 --> 00:11:19,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it presupposed situations in which
you can't know your adversary.</font>

192
00:11:20,200 --> 00:11:21,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's for sure...</font>

193
00:11:21,740 --> 00:11:25,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I never dreamed that this guy
could make sand into a weapon.</font>

194
00:11:26,080 --> 00:11:28,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, this is not the case
in the Final Round.</font>

195
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:34,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Some of you might have already
revealed everything in front of your rivals...</font>

196
00:11:35,090 --> 00:11:37,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the spirit of fairness and equality,</font>

197
00:11:37,340 --> 00:11:41,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you will have a month to
train yourself to further your skills.</font>

198
00:11:55,440 --> 00:11:57,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, I can't be thinking of this</font>

199
00:11:57,360 --> 00:12:00,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as some sort of month-long
holiday and do nothing!</font>

200
00:12:00,400 --> 00:12:02,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seriously! Seriously!</font>

201
00:12:14,670 --> 00:12:17,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It might not be a good idea to
excel too much, is it?</font>

202
00:12:17,800 --> 00:12:22,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We failed to stay out of Orochimaru-sama's
watchful eye,</font>

203
00:12:22,680 --> 00:12:24,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and it was unfortunate for us both.</font>

204
00:12:25,090 --> 00:12:28,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Under this gentle exterior,
a seed of evil took root-</font>

205
00:12:29,520 --> 00:12:30,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and it was this seed that was exploited...</font>

206
00:12:31,560 --> 00:12:33,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Some day, through that Ninjutsu...</font>

207
00:12:34,480 --> 00:12:35,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">this child will as well...</font>

208
00:12:41,570 --> 00:12:42,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kabuto...</font>

209
00:12:43,320 --> 00:12:44,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who knows?</font>

210
00:12:45,070 --> 00:12:47,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Perhaps he really will kill Sasuke-kun.</font>

211
00:13:03,170 --> 00:13:04,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have to give it you, Kakashi-san...</font>

212
00:13:05,840 --> 00:13:08,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stopping my attack from your blind spot...</font>

213
00:13:09,260 --> 00:13:14,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, you'd better ready at least
10 of your men next time.</font>

214
00:13:18,150 --> 00:13:21,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The ANBU that I prepared were
taken out without difficulty...</font>

215
00:13:22,650 --> 00:13:25,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're not an ordinary Genin are you?</font>

216
00:13:25,860 --> 00:13:29,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You caught a whiff of me and immediately
readied your weapon...</font>

217
00:13:29,450 --> 00:13:30,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you're quite impressive.</font>

218
00:13:31,290 --> 00:13:33,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, I'm not all that.</font>

219
00:13:34,160 --> 00:13:35,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you want with Sasuke?</font>

220
00:13:36,040 --> 00:13:38,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Depending on circumstances,
I'll haul you off to questioning.</font>

221
00:13:40,210 --> 00:13:43,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if that's possible
for the likes of you...</font>

222
00:13:44,880 --> 00:13:47,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you looking to take me on?</font>

223
00:13:51,600 --> 00:13:55,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are the son of the chief of the
Leaf medical corps, aren't you?</font>

224
00:13:56,310 --> 00:13:59,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your name, was it, Yakushi Kabuto?</font>

225
00:14:01,900 --> 00:14:04,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you affiliated with Orochimaru?</font>

226
00:14:06,110 --> 00:14:08,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you arrest me here now,</font>

227
00:14:08,700 --> 00:14:11,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you might never be able to prove
my connection to Orochimaru.</font>

228
00:14:12,160 --> 00:14:14,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up and confine your answers
to my questions.</font>

229
00:14:15,290 --> 00:14:16,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What if I say "No"?</font>

230
00:14:17,620 --> 00:14:19,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm the one asking the
questions around here.</font>

231
00:14:20,250 --> 00:14:21,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now give me some answers.</font>

232
00:14:21,880 --> 00:14:24,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll find out before long anyway
if you let me go,</font>

233
00:14:25,670 --> 00:14:28,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so can you make an exception
just this once?</font>

234
00:14:28,510 --> 00:14:31,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You, willful little brat...</font>

235
00:14:32,890 --> 00:14:34,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't mess around with grown-ups.</font>

236
00:14:35,470 --> 00:14:38,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be so arrogant.</font>

237
00:14:39,020 --> 00:14:41,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The circumstances are in my favor...</font>

238
00:15:08,760 --> 00:15:10,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I should have known.</font>

239
00:15:12,470 --> 00:15:13,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A shadow clone!</font>

240
00:15:41,920 --> 00:15:43,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn... I've let him escape.</font>

241
00:15:49,470 --> 00:15:50,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Impressive...</font>

242
00:15:56,100 --> 00:15:57,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As I suspected...</font>

243
00:15:57,640 --> 00:15:58,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the Dead Soul Jutsu,</font>

244
00:15:58,930 --> 00:16:01,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">where one temporarily animates
and controls the heart of a dead body.</font>

245
00:16:03,060 --> 00:16:05,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Meticulously transforming even the face...</font>

246
00:16:06,650 --> 00:16:10,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and also stopping his heartbeats
and eliminating all traces of his body odor...</font>

247
00:16:10,990 --> 00:16:15,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in order to prepare an escape by
impersonating a murdered ANBU...</font>

248
00:16:17,450 --> 00:16:20,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He wasn't raised as the adopted son of
the chief of the medical corps for nothing.</font>

249
00:16:21,910 --> 00:16:24,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If someone this good is working
for Orochimaru...</font>

250
00:16:26,290 --> 00:16:27,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't stay as I am now...</font>

251
00:16:30,090 --> 00:16:31,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now that that's done...</font>

252
00:16:31,760 --> 00:16:35,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd like to let you take your leave...</font>

253
00:16:35,260 --> 00:16:37,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But first, for the Final Round,</font>

254
00:16:37,600 --> 00:16:41,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there is one more important
matter to take care of.</font>

255
00:16:41,100 --> 00:16:45,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's get on with it,
so we can get to training!</font>

256
00:16:45,690 --> 00:16:49,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, now. I want you all to
calmly take one slip of paper</font>

257
00:16:49,570 --> 00:16:52,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">from the box that Anko is holding.</font>

258
00:16:52,440 --> 00:16:57,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to go around in order...
take only one.</font>

259
00:17:06,500 --> 00:17:08,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good, everyone has taken
a number.</font>

260
00:17:08,460 --> 00:17:12,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, from left to right, tell me
the number on your slip of paper.</font>

261
00:17:12,630 --> 00:17:13,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm eight.</font>

262
00:17:14,630 --> 00:17:15,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm one.</font>

263
00:17:16,340 --> 00:17:17,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seven.</font>

264
00:17:17,680 --> 00:17:18,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Five.</font>

265
00:17:19,050 --> 00:17:19,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Three.</font>

266
00:17:20,010 --> 00:17:20,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nine.</font>

267
00:17:20,970 --> 00:17:21,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Two.</font>

268
00:17:21,640 --> 00:17:22,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Six.</font>

269
00:17:23,020 --> 00:17:25,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words, he has number four.</font>

270
00:17:26,400 --> 00:17:27,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh-huh.</font>

271
00:17:28,060 --> 00:17:29,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Very well, I will tell you</font>

272
00:17:29,900 --> 00:17:32,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">about how the Final Round
tournament will work.</font>

273
00:17:33,860 --> 00:17:35,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

274
00:17:35,360 --> 00:17:37,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that what these
drawing lots were for?</font>

275
00:17:37,780 --> 00:17:40,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ibiki, bring forth the pairings.</font>

276
00:17:40,870 --> 00:17:41,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, sir.</font>

