<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's so far away.</font>

287
00:17:51,210 --> 00:17:54,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that all the Final Round is,
a tournament?</font>

288
00:17:54,760 --> 00:17:56,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Crap! I have one extra round.</font>

289
00:17:57,470 --> 00:18:00,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Vendetta for Choji?
Give me a break!</font>

290
00:18:02,510 --> 00:18:05,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm so relieved to know that
I won't be in the same section as Gaara.</font>

291
00:18:05,560 --> 00:18:07,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uchiha Sasuke...</font>

292
00:18:08,150 --> 00:18:09,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Perfect.</font>

293
00:18:10,270 --> 00:18:13,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hyuga Neji, right off the bat?</font>

294
00:18:14,570 --> 00:18:16,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This couldn't be better!</font>

295
00:18:18,240 --> 00:18:20,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun has to go up against him...?</font>

296
00:18:25,620 --> 00:18:27,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could I ask a question?</font>

297
00:18:27,290 --> 00:18:28,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go ahead.</font>

298
00:18:28,370 --> 00:18:32,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Does this mean that there will
only be one winner of the tournament?</font>

299
00:18:32,920 --> 00:18:37,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That only one of us will be
able to become a Chunin?</font>

300
00:18:37,760 --> 00:18:39,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, on the contrary.</font>

301
00:18:39,970 --> 00:18:43,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The judges of the Final Round,
of which I am one,</font>

302
00:18:43,390 --> 00:18:44,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">will be made up of the Kazekage,</font>

303
00:18:44,770 --> 00:18:47,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Feudal Lords from various countries
who will assign you your missions,</font>

304
00:18:47,600 --> 00:18:50,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the Shinobi Leaders.</font>

305
00:18:51,060 --> 00:18:52,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Through this tournament,</font>

306
00:18:52,900 --> 00:18:57,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">these judges will be able to make
a thorough evaluation,</font>

307
00:18:57,240 --> 00:18:59,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and come to a decision as to
whether each one of you</font>

308
00:18:59,400 --> 00:19:02,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">possesses the qualities incumbent
of a Chunin.</font>

309
00:19:02,370 --> 00:19:07,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if someone loses the first round,
they can still become a Chunin.</font>

310
00:19:07,450 --> 00:19:12,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So there's a chance that all
of us will become Chunin?</font>

311
00:19:12,880 --> 00:19:17,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Correct, but conversely,
there's also a chance that none of you will.</font>

