324
00:19:29,390 --> 00:19:32,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is all a real pain in my...</font>

325
00:19:33,230 --> 00:19:35,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you for your patience.</font>

326
00:19:35,320 --> 00:19:37,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We will adjourn until next month.</font>

327
00:19:37,860 --> 00:19:40,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The second round will either be
No Eyebrows from Sand or Sasuke, huh?</font>

328
00:19:42,240 --> 00:19:44,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That guy is so strong he kicked
Bushy Brow's butt.</font>

329
00:19:45,030 --> 00:19:46,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sand Coffin!</font>

330
00:19:53,670 --> 00:19:56,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to fight you, too.</font>

331
00:20:02,470 --> 00:20:04,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now that it's come to this,
I've got to see Kakashi-sensei.</font>

332
00:20:04,930 --> 00:20:08,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Umm, where's the room
that Sasuke's in?</font>

333
00:20:08,270 --> 00:20:10,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry. Sasuke-sama
is not allowed visitors.</font>

334
00:20:10,770 --> 00:20:13,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! Hey, hey!
What's up with that?!</font>

335
00:20:13,400 --> 00:20:14,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry, those are the rules.</font>

336
00:20:14,980 --> 00:20:16,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why, nee-chan, tell me why?</font>

337
00:20:16,440 --> 00:20:19,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, this is a hospital.
Keep it down.</font>

338
00:20:20,400 --> 00:20:21,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi-sensei!</font>

339
00:20:22,030 --> 00:20:23,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Hey!</font>

340
00:20:23,610 --> 00:20:25,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've got a favor to ask!</font>

341
00:20:25,370 --> 00:20:26,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't need to say it all.</font>

342
00:20:27,580 --> 00:20:29,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I thought it would
come to this so...</font>

343
00:20:29,580 --> 00:20:32,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I searched for someone
to watch your training.</font>

344
00:20:32,790 --> 00:20:36,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?! I want you to, Kakashi-sensei!</font>

345
00:20:36,460 --> 00:20:38,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have some matters to take care of.</font>

346
00:20:38,840 --> 00:20:41,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't have the time to trouble
myself with you.</font>

347
00:20:43,470 --> 00:20:45,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! Aha...!</font>

348
00:20:46,300 --> 00:20:48,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're going to train
Sasuke, aren't you!</font>

349
00:20:49,100 --> 00:20:50,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, don't say that.</font>

350
00:20:51,140 --> 00:20:54,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I found a sensei who's
more reliable than I am!</font>

351
00:20:54,390 --> 00:20:56,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well... who is it?</font>

352
00:20:57,190 --> 00:20:58,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's me!</font>

353
00:20:58,440 --> 00:20:59,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

354
00:21:01,280 --> 00:21:02,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You!</font>

355
00:21:02,190 --> 00:21:04,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Closet Perv!</font>

356
00:21:04,200 --> 00:21:05,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Such insolence!</font>

357
00:21:06,340 --> 00:21:11,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">hey, can you hear it?</font></b></font></font>

358
00:21:06,340 --> 00:21:11,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Gandhi Sans">nee kikoe masu ka</font></b></font>

359
00:21:11,360 --> 00:21:20,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">sora wa hate shinaku aoku sunde ite</font></b></font></font></font>

360
00:21:11,360 --> 00:21:20,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">the clear, blue sky goes on and on</font></b></font></font></font>

361
00:21:20,070 --> 00:21:29,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">umi wa kagiri naku koudai de ite</font></b></font></font>

362
00:21:20,070 --> 00:21:29,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">the ocean spans limitlessly</font></b></font></font></font>

363
00:21:29,320 --> 00:21:38,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">kimi wa itsumade mo egao de ite</font></b></font></font>

364
00:21:29,320 --> 00:21:38,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">please keep that smile on your face forever</font></b></font></font></font>

365
00:21:38,390 --> 00:21:44,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">janai to nai chau kara</font></b></font></font>

