<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">the two are one</font></b></font></font>

383
00:22:22,620 --> 00:22:28,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">HARUMONIA kanji Te TEREPASHII</font></b></font></font>

384
00:22:22,620 --> 00:22:28,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">harmonia, feel the telepathy</font></b></font></font>

385
00:22:29,340 --> 00:22:34,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">nee kikoe masu ka</font></b></font></font>

386
00:22:29,340 --> 00:22:34,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">hey, can you hear it?</font></b></font></font>

387
00:22:38,790 --> 00:22:41,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Damn it! I'm not satisfied with this!</font>

388
00:22:41,380 --> 00:22:43,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I don't care if you're an
elite tutor or whatever,</font>

389
00:22:43,380 --> 00:22:45,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">but there's no way
I'm not going to get stronger</font>

390
00:22:45,590 --> 00:22:47,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">if I'm to learn from the Closet Perv
weaker than me!</font>

391
00:22:47,800 --> 00:22:50,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I have to get strong by any
means necessary, no matter what!</font>

392
00:22:51,390 --> 00:22:53,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">If you're really a strong ninja,</font>

393
00:22:53,600 --> 00:22:56,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">just try to convince me
with your sheer strength!</font>

394
00:22:57,230 --> 00:23:01,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next episode:
"Ebisu Returns! I Will Not Allow Shamelessness!"</font>

395
00:23:02,150 --> 00:23:04,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I'm gonna win this time around, too!</font>

